    <briefdescription>
<para>Like <computeroutput><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_b_l_a_k_e3" kindref="compound">BLAKE3</ref></computeroutput> but using a class-level template parameter for specifying the hash size of the <computeroutput><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_truncated_b_l_a_k_e3_1a74a099d51430f54417d27af6f552d183" kindref="member">final()</ref></computeroutput> and <computeroutput><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_truncated_b_l_a_k_e3_1adda4f5df8b748e9f3c27dc9872b52330" kindref="member">result()</ref></computeroutput> functions. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This is useful for using <ref refid="classllvm_1_1_b_l_a_k_e3" kindref="compound">BLAKE3</ref> as the hasher type for <computeroutput><ref refid="classllvm_1_1_hash_builder" kindref="compound">HashBuilder</ref></computeroutput> with non-default hash sizes. </para>
